        "y1": 0.7918504792787656
      },
      "text": "Remark 1.5 Because of the difficulty on the structure of solutions, there has not been too many works on the construction of blowup solutions of Liouville systems. In [22] Huang constructed a sequence of one-bubble blowup solutions under further restrictions. In this article we removed all the extra assumptions and constructed the multi-bubble blowup solutions without additional restrictions.",
